Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

Downloaded the installer for "7.1.0.2 Clients" for windows x86 from the above location (http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg24019253)
Installed the Websphere MQ client 7.1.0.2 on my local machine.

Search for com.ibm.mqjms.jar under installation directory. It is typically present at <installation_dir>/java/lib

Check in the file com.ibm.mqjms.jar to adks/websphere/mq/7.1.0.2 in cmvc.

